  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multiannual strategic partnership between the Ministry of Foreign Affairs of the Government of the Netherlands (MFA) and the International Crisis Group (Crisis Group) which supports the organization in its mission of global conflict prevention and resolution activities. The partnership provides the MFA with valued activities in priority conflict situations in line with the MFA&apos;s Security and Rule of Law Theory of Change and Results Framework.</narrative>
